 "func_desc_layout": "full",
 "func_desc": [
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "marker": "-",
   "level": 0,
   "items": [
    "Full replace (delete - insert); all columns are copied as they are, no conversion. HOLD_FLAG and PO_MAPPED_FLAG are Supplier System-only columns (set in ASN Crossdock Creation): before the delete their values are kept per unique key and put back on the inserted rows; a new key gets 'N'. Cancel is not done in Supplier System: the source sends the cancelled order with ORDER_STATUS '2' (crossdock orders have '7'); Supplier System only holds, so a cancel applies to lines already on hold (HOLD_FLAG = 'Y'). Lines with status '2' are not taken by X12.",
    "Delete and insert run in one transaction (all-or-nothing). When the run fails, Supplier System keeps the data of the last successful run.",
    "Schedule is set in the system master (TBC). Table structure: see Appendix."
   ]
  }
 ],
